        "r": 548.4046900000003,
        "b": 493.05283
      },
      "content": "Reinstall the shims under the frame foot and tighten the frame foot to the baseplate. Make sure that you use the proper shim. Mount a dial indicator in order to measure the distance between the top of the frame and the baseplate. Make sure that the distance does not change as you tighten the frame-foot bolts.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_2102",
      "parent_section_id": null,
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
