        "l": 144.00465000000003,
        "t": 490.49282999999997,
        "r": 551.4146500000004,
        "b": 440.73283999999995
      },
      "content": "Check the total clearance of  the impeller in the casing. With new parts, an acceptable range is 0.030 in. (0.76 mm) to 0.065 in. (1.65 mm). If  the impeller clearance is outside of  this range, you either have the incorrect parts, an improper installation, or too much pipe strain. Determine the cause and correct the problem before you proceed.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_2102",
      "parent_section_id": null,
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
